    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d375">

                <pb facs="0471" n="305" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg305"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 818.00/72</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Hale to the
                            Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Extract]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">San José</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-02-05T13:00:00-05:36">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 5, 1917—1 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>I sent ex-President González and Castro Quesada to Limon by special train in
                    charge of John M. Keith, special agent of the Legation, and clerk Smith. They
                    were safely delivered to the <hi rendition="#italic">Metapan</hi> which sailed
                    last night at 9.30.</p>
                <p>Ex-President González asked me to ask the United States Government not to
                    recognize Tinoco. I suppose he means if Tinoco should be elected President as a
                    result of his call for a constitutional assembly.</p>
                <p>There is absolute quiet and all affairs proceed as before the <hi
                        rendition="#italic">coup d’état</hi>. It has almost ceased to be
                    discussed.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hale</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
